    "summary": "",
    "extractedText": "--- पान 1 ---\nShashikala A. Jolle Bharatiya Janata Party\nMLA- Nipani Karnataka\nPresident - Mahila Morcha w\nKarnataka State\n_—\nRef. No. Date : ००.८ 19०१5\nTo\nShri Suresh Prabhu Ji\nHon. Minister of Railways\nGovt. of India\nNew Delhi\nSub : Karad — Ichalkaranji — Nipani — Belagavi Railway Line.\nSir\n\nThe Survey of Karad — Belagavi Railway Line has taken place before two years. Its\nreport is also submitted to the Ministry of Railways. This line will connect 17 new towns and\n50 villages that will help the common people of this area. Due to this, Rail connectivity,\nfaster development of this region is also possible and even new Industries will arrive in the\nsurroundings.\n\nThis line will also make the transportation between three states Maharashtra,\nKarnataka and Goa faster and convenient. There are various industries in the surroundings\ne.g. Ichalkaranji -Textile, Hupri -Silver, Nipani —Tobacco, Kagal - MIDC ete. which will\nflourish more if this project comes through.\n\nThis Railway Line will also connect religious places in Maharashtra and Karnataka\nlike Bahubali, Kunthagiri, Vipashyana Kendra , Stawanidhi, Appachi Wadi, Aadi,\nRamteerth and also hill station Amboli.\n\nIn comparison with other states, Karnataka state has less Rail Communication. I am\nsure , you will personally look in to this matter positively and in the next budget will\nsanction Karad — Ichalkaranji — Nipani — Belagavi Rail Line.\n\nThanking you\nYours sincerely\nForni\nShashikala Jolle\nMLA — Nipani (Karnataka)\nCopy to,\nNl Sou. Shubhangi Shrikant Biranje\nPresident Railway kruti samiti & City Prisident\nIchalakaranji Nagarparishad, Ichalakaranji\nन\nOffice : Pattanshetti Buildina Rani Channamma Circle Ninani Tal - Chikodi Diet - Relaanm - 501237\n",
