    "extractedText": "--- पान 1 ---\nसत्यमेव जयते\nChh. Udayan Raje Bhonsle\nMEMBER OF PARLIAMENT\n(LOK SABHA)\n\nON-IMP/  /W.S/15\nDate:-18 Oct.,15\n\nTo,\n\nHon. Shri. Suresh Prabhu,\n\nMinister of Indian Railway,\n\nRail Bhavan,\n\nNew Delhi.\n\nSub:-Building up a new railway track between Karad, Dist —\n\nSatara (Maharashtra) and Dharwad, Dist-Dharwad (Karnataka)\nRespected sir,\n\n1 wish to bring the above matter for your kind consideration. By rail the\ndistance between Karad and Kolhapur is 124kms and it takes near about 2.30 hours\nto Kolhapur. The distance between these two cities by NH-4 is only 70kms, which\nis journey of 1 hour. The distance between Kolhapur and Dharwad(Karnataka), if\ntraveled by train is about 308kms via Khanapur, Londha, Stations etc. If the new\ntrack is planned between Karad and Dharawad via Nipani, Belgum which will save\na journey of 180kms. Pune and Dharawad these two important LT. cities can be\nconnected by nearest distance, which can help for industrial growth of both the\ncities.\n\nWe often discuss about the saving of fuel and time, which is need of hour.\nTherefore, I request you to please instruct the concerned officers/department to\nlook into this proposal and do the needful survey of the proposed new track as early\nas possible.\n\nOnce again 1 request you to please look into this matter and make the\nnecessary budget provision for this survey work in the railway budget for 2010-\n2011.\n\nThanking you,\nYours Faithfully\nde — ~\nimant Chhatrapati je Bhonsle)\nMember of Parliament, SATARA\n",
